# run.sh's own scratch: server logs, recreated on every start.
.run-*.log
.run-pids

# CAPTURED SITES — 1.7 GB, and not ours. They lived in `case_studies/` here and
# moved OUT of this repository to the workspace's business/case_studies on
# 18 Sep 2026; the rule stays so a copy dropped back here cannot be committed.
# They are whole mirrors of other people's websites (stoma.games, example),
# captured so the interior can be demonstrated over a real page rather than a mock. They are evidence, not
# source: nothing here is authored, none of it is licensed to us to redistribute,
# and a clone that carried them would be three orders of magnitude larger than
# the code it exists to serve.
#
# `run.sh` needs them (from business/case_studies) to serve :8101 and :8102. Without them the case-study pages
# 404 and everything else — the embed demos, the keyholder, the two-device
# harness, the wasm tests — works untouched.
case_studies/

# BUILT BY build-wasm.sh, from core/core-wasm. Committing it would put a binary
# in this repo whose source is in another one, so the two would drift with
# nothing to catch it — which is the whole failure `core-wasm` exists to prevent.
*.wasm
docs/core/

.DS_Store
keyholder/core/

# STAGED BESIDE THE CORE, by account/stage.sh, for the same reason: the source
# is account/pacific-account.js and these are copies of it. A committed copy is
# a copy that drifts from the original with nothing to catch it -- and the one
# thing this file must never differ on between surfaces is a key derivation.
docs/pacific-account.js
# The client and what it reads, staged beside pacific.js for other sites to load
# (account/stage.sh, SERVED_BESIDE_PACIFIC). Build artefacts: shared/ is the source.
docs/wallflowers-client.js
docs/wallflowers-client.d.ts
docs/wallflowers-fold.js
docs/wallflowers-ops.js
docs/wallflowers-sim.json
docs/wallflowers-sim.js
docs/wallflowers-sim-site.json
docs/wallflowers-sim-site.js
keyholder/pacific-account.js
keyholder/wallflowers-ops.js

# mobile/: staged build artefacts and the generated archive fixture
mobile/core/
mobile/pacific-account.js
mobile/fixture/
mobile/wallflowers-fold.js
mobile/wallflowers-ops.js
demo/__pycache__/
